#: squid/bot/submission/consent_banner.py:56
msgid ""
"Redstone Squid automatically indexes redstone doors and builds posted in "
"this channel. Agreeing stores your Discord user ID and records this "
"consent, allowing the bot to attribute your builds, mirror media, and "
"analyze attached schematics. Cancelling stores nothing and leaves your "
